{
  "case": "jingmo_dataset_import_no_transaction",
  "status": "included",
  "mechanism": "The dataset-sync page imports the classic-poem dataset by iterating the parsed JSON array and issuing one standalone RDB INSERT per poem (each in its own autocommit transaction, all fired concurrently via a non-awaited map). Importing thousands of rows generates thousands of individual journal/fsync cycles, saturating the DB writer and freezing the sync page for a long time.",
  "fix_summary": "Dataset import uses RdbStore.batchInsert so the whole array is inserted in a single transaction; the per-row debug logging is removed.",
